{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T10:50:57.535636", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_uig9ac", "task_desc": "Create a new contact in my contact list with the first name Arnold, the last name Schwarzenegger, and the email address arnold@fitness.com. After you have him added, send him an email with the subject \"Biceps Exercises?\" and in the content, ask him for his top 5 biceps exercises. This coming Sunday, create an event titled \"Apartment Tour\" from 2:00 to 4:00 that afternoon. Find the lowest priced property on my saved apartments list in the 211 43 zip code that has a Gym as an amenity and let me kn", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "I'll break down this task into sub-requests:\n1. Create contact Arnold Schwarzenegger with email arnold@fitness.com\n2. Send him an email with subject \"Biceps Exercises?\" asking for top 5 biceps exercises\n3. Create \"Apartment Tour\" event this Sunday 2:00-4:00 PM\n4. Find lowest priced saved apartment in 211 43 zip with Gym amenity, report name\n5. Order default cab from Home at 1:00 PM Sunday to that property\n6. Send private Chats message to Vasco Pinto about gyms in 211 43\n\nLet me start by gathering information in parallel where possible.\nThe contact is created. Now let me check the saved apartments more thoroughly - I need to find ones in zip code \"211 43\" with a Gym amenity. The list was truncated. Let me search specifically.\nLet me fix the boolean type.\nThe tool seems to require a proper boolean. Let me try without saved_only and filter manually, but first let me get the full saved apartments list. Let me list all saved apartments with a larger view.\nThe list is being truncated. Let me search all apartments (not just saved) with the zip code and Gym filter to find candidates, then cross-reference with saved. Let me try the search with proper boolean handling by passing it differently.\nFound one apartment in zip 211 43 with Gym: \"Malmö Modern\" (saved: true, price 1300). Let me verify there are no other saved apartments in that zip with Gym by checking the full saved list. The search returned only one result with Gym in 211 43, and it's saved. Let me confirm by getting the full saved list to ensure I'm not missing any. Let me check the remaining saved apartments.\nThe saved_only parameter has a type issue. The previous search (all apartments) for zip 211 43 with Gym returned only \"Malmö Modern\" which is saved. To be thorough, let me verify there are no other saved apartments in 211 43 with Gym by listing all apartments in that zip and checking which are saved.\nOnly one apartment exists in zip 211 43, and it's \"Malmö Modern\" with Gym amenity, saved, price 1300. This is the lowest (and only) priced property matching the criteria.\n\nNow let me determine this coming Sunday's date. Current date is 2024-10-15 (Tuesday). This coming Sunday is 2024-10-20. Let me proceed with the remaining actions:\n- Send email to Arnold\n- Create calendar event Sunday 2-4 PM\n- Order cab Sunday 1 PM from Home to Malmö Modern\n- Send Chats message to Vasco Pinto\n\nLet me do these in parallel.\nThe calendar event, cab ride, and Chats message are done. The email failed because recipients must be a list. Let me fix and resend.\nAll sub-requests are now complete. Let me verify everything was done:\n\n1. ✅ Contact Arnold Schwarzenegger (arnold@fitness.com) created\n2. ✅ Email sent with subject \"Biceps Exercises?\" asking for top 5 biceps exercises\n3. ✅ Calendar event \"Apartment Tour\" created for Sunday 2024-10-20, 2:00-4:00 PM\n4. ✅ Found lowest priced saved apartment in 211 43 with Gym: Malmö Modern\n5. ✅ Default cab ordered from Home at 1:00 PM Sunday to Malmö Modern\n6. ✅ Chats message sent to Vasco Pinto about gyms in 211 43\n\nLet me send the final summary to the user.\nAll tasks have been completed successfully. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n1. **Contact created** — Arnold Schwarzenegger (arnold@fitness.com) added to your contacts.\n2. **Email sent** — Sent to arnold@fitness.com with subject \"Biceps Exercises?\" asking for his top 5 biceps exercises.\n3. **Calendar event created** — \"Apartment Tour\" on Sunday, Oct 20, 2024 from 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM.\n4. **Saved apartment in 211 43 with Gym** — The lowest (and only) matching property is **Malmö Modern** (Södra Förstadsgatan 20, Malmö), price 1300, with Gym and Laundry amenities.\n5. **Cab ordered** — A Default ride booked from Home at 1:00 PM Sunday, Oct 20, to Malmö Modern (estimated ~25 min, ~15 km).\n6. **Chats message sent** — Messaged Vasco Pinto asking about good gyms in the 211 43 zip code.\nNo new follow-up message arrived within the wait window. All sub-requests from the original task have been completed:\n\n1. ✅ Contact Arnold Schwarzenegger (arnold@fitness.com) created\n2. ✅ Email sent with subject \"Biceps Exercises?\" asking for top 5 biceps exercises\n3. ✅ Calendar event \"Apartment Tour\" created for Sunday, Oct 20, 2024, 2:00–4:00 PM\n4. ✅ Lowest priced saved apartment in 211 43 with Gym: **Malmö Modern**\n5. ✅ Default cab ordered from Home at 1:00 PM Sunday to Malmö Modern\n6. ✅ Chats message sent to Vasco Pinto about gyms in 211 43\n\nThe task is fully handled. No further action is needed.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-338b1dad-9bc0-4b6d-b3ec-d9c8efa7a9b0", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-56270572-7b98-4c1d-8637-2b85818990e8"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Contacts", "function": "add_new_contact", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "first_name", "value": "Arnold", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "last_name", "value": "Schwarzenegger", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "gender", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "age", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[int]"}, {"name": "nationality", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "city_living", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "country", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "status", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "job", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "phone", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "email", "value": "arnold@fitness.com", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "address", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-df0c1253-f02a-4f7c-8d4a-39cb25d3fc64", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-56270572-7b98-4c1d-8637-2b85818990e8"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "Apartment Tour", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-20 14:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-20 16:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "location", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "attendees", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-e9c51e76-8cb8-47f2-b8ca-7e8c28059903", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-56270572-7b98-4c1d-8637-2b85818990e8"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "Malmö Modern", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-0a403262-2c50-4