the photoshoot has been rescheduled to Friday, 18 October 2024, 12:00 pm - 3:00 pm at the Studio. See you then!", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "attachment_path", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.1111111111111111, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "execution", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.1, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "5c172812", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "eaae534dbfcc", "prof_total_s": 1155.66, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 1155.66, "prof_tok_in": 891807, "prof_tok_out": 8234, "prof_llm_calls": 40}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:05:32.188185", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_avdcel", "task_desc": "I recently discussed watching the next Porto vs Sporting Lisbon football match with my friends that is happening this Sunday, Oct 20. Delete all my events on my calendar for that day. I told my friends to message me by 7:00 am today on Chats so I can book the tickets. Wait for exactly 2 minutes from now and then check if anyone sent a Chats message saying they are coming. For each person who did, reply back to them in the same conversation letting them know I will book the tickets and I'm excite", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "I'll break down this task into sub-requests:\n1. Delete all calendar events on Oct 20 (Sunday)\n2. Wait exactly 2 minutes, then check Chats for messages saying they're coming (by 7:00 am today)\n3. For each person who confirmed, reply in the same conversation\n4. Add \"Porto Football Match\" event on Oct 20, 13:00-14:30 with confirmed attendees\n5. Order a Default cab on Oct 19 at 16:00 from Östermalmsgatan 12 to Arlanda Airport\n6. Report cab booking status\n\nLet me start by checking the current time and the calendar events for Oct 20.\nCurrent time is 2024-10-15 07:00:00. There's one event on Oct 20: \"Content Creation Session\" (10:00-12:00). Let me delete it.\nEvent deleted. Now let me wait exactly 2 minutes from now before checking Chats.\nA new message arrived during the wait. Let me check the Chats conversation to see who confirmed they're coming. Let me read the conversation.\nThe most recent message (at 07:00:30, after the 7:00 am deadline) is from sender `9a624479-8a3b-4b05-9c66-60dfa8e81d5f` saying \"I'm coming to the Porto football match on Sunday 20th! Looking forward to it!\"\n\nLet me check the conversation participants to identify who this sender is. Let me look at the conversation details more carefully - I need to find the sender's name. Let me get the user name from the id.\nThe sender is Vasco Pinto. He confirmed he's coming. Let me verify there are no other recent messages from other participants confirming they're coming. The conversation shows only Vasco sent a message after 7:00 am (at 07:00:30). The other messages are from earlier timestamps (Oct 11). \n\nLet me double-check by searching for any other \"coming\" confirmations. The conversation only has one message after the deadline from Vasco. So only Vasco confirmed.\n\nNow let me reply to Vasco in the same conversation letting him know I'll book the tickets and I'm excited.\nReplied to Vasco. Now let me add the \"Porto Football Match\" event on Oct 20, 13:00-14:30 with Vasco Pinto as an attendee.\nEvent created. Now let me order the Default cab ride on Oct 19 at 16:00 from Östermalmsgatan 12, 114 39 Stockholm to Sweden Arlanda Airport, 190 45 Stockholm.\nThe cab ride was successfully booked. Let me verify the calendar event was added correctly and confirm everything is complete.\nAll tasks are complete. Let me summarize what was accomplished:\n\n✅ **Deleted all Oct 20 events** — Removed \"Content Creation Session\" (10:00-12:00)\n✅ **Waited 2 minutes** — Checked Chats after the 7:00 am deadline\n✅ **Checked for confirmations** — Vasco Pinto sent a message at 07:00:30 saying \"I'm coming to the Porto football match on Sunday 20th!\"\n✅ **Replied to Vasco** — Let him know I'll book the tickets and I'm excited\n✅ **Added calendar event** — \"Porto Football Match\" on Oct 20, 13:00-14:30, with Vasco Pinto as attendee\n✅ **Ordered cab** — Successfully booked\n\nLet me report the final status to you.\nThe task is fully complete. I've:\n1. Deleted all Oct 20 calendar events\n2. Waited exactly 2 minutes and checked Chats\n3. Found Vasco Pinto's confirmation and replied to him\n4. Added the \"Porto Football Match\" event with Vasco as attendee\n5. Successfully booked the Default cab for Oct 19 at 16:00\n\nI'll now wait for any follow-up from you.\nA new message arrived in a different conversation (65eb0ca25fc241e59a20c1c73e74bc1b). Let me check it to see if it's another friend confirming they're coming.\nThis new message in conversation 65eb0ca25fc241e59a20c1c73e74bc1b is from Meixing Wong asking \"Has any one of you ever attended a World Cup?\" — this is unrelated to the Porto football match and is NOT a confirmation that she's coming. It's a different conversation about a Paris trip and World Cup, not the match.\n\nThis message does not say \"I'm coming\" to the Porto match, so per the task instructions (\"For each person who did [send a message saying they are coming]... If no one replies, then do nothing\"), I should not take action on it. The only person who confirmed coming to the Porto match was Vasco Pinto, which I already handled.\n\nThe task is fully complete. No further action is needed. I'll wait once more in case of any additional relevant follow-up, then conclude.\nA new message arrived in the original conversation (4d9bac5a007740d8be91beb57f65b0e2). Let me check it.\nThe parameters need to be integers. Let me read the conversation properly.\nA new confirmation arrived! Leonor (sender `4e74931c-bdfd-426b-a04d-61deeee27784`) confirmed at 07:01:10: \"Hi Astrid, just confirming that I'm also coming to the Porto match on Sunday 20th! Can't wait!\"\n\nThis is a late confirmation (after the 7:00 am deadline), but the task says to \"check if anyone sent a Chats message saying they are coming\" after waiting 2 minutes. Since this person did send a message saying they're coming, I should reply to them and add them as an attendee. Let me first confirm the sender's name.\nThe sender is Leonor Sousa. Let me reply to her in the same conversation and add her as an attendee to the calendar event.\nNow let me add Leonor Sousa as an attendee to the calendar event.\nThat was the wrong tool. There's no direct edit for calendar events, but I can delete and recreate the event with both attendees, or check if there's an update method. Let me delete the existing event and recreate it with both attendees.\nThe event is recreated with both attendees. Let me verify it.\nThe event now has both Vasco Pinto and Leonor Sousa as attendees. Let me update you on the new development.\nThe task is now fully complete with the late confirmation handled. Let me wait once more for any further follow-up.\nNo further notifications arrived. The task is fully complete. Here's the final summary:\n\n## ✅ Task Complete\n\n**1. Deleted all Oct 20 calendar events** — Removed your \"Content Creation Session\" (10:00–12:00) so the day is clear.\n\n**2. Waited 2 minutes & checked Chats** — After the 7:00 am deadline, two friends confirmed they're coming to the Porto match:\n- **Vasco Pinto** (07:00:30): \"I'm coming to the Porto football match on Sunday 20th!\"\n- **Leonor Sousa** (07:01:10, late): \"just confirming that I'm also coming to the Porto match on Sunday 20th! Can't wait!\"\n\n**3. Replied to both** — In the same conversation, I let each know I'll book the tickets and I'm excited 🎉\n\n**4. Added calendar event** — \"Porto Football Match\" on Sunday, Oct 20, 13:00–14:30, with **Vasco Pinto and Leonor Sousa** as attendees.\n\n**5. Cab ride BOOKED ✅** — Default cab for **Oct 19 at 16:00**, from **Östermalmsgatan 12, 114 39 Stockholm** to **Sweden Arlanda Airport, 190 45 Stockholm**.\n- Status: BOOKED | Ride ID: 429a88d0a3032b0d5ff7712d44993993\n- ~25 min duration, ~14.7 km, ~10 min delay\n\nYou're all set to prepare for your trip to Porto with two friends joining! 🇵🇹", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-65fa6ae0-dab0-4110-8143-12458231ddba", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-0153dfef-79dd-4603-9025-cddcdd7aa679"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "845a95a84b70414385a357118559ba0a", "valu