{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:11:11.725006", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_fed6nl", "task_desc": "Place an order for the only polyester material variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt. After placing the order, send an email to Birgitta Larsson letting her know to cancel the order if she wanted the only red color variant of the Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt rather than the product I both. After sending the email to Birgitta Larsson, send me a message confirming that the email has been sent. If the order is canceled, place an order for the other product, then send an ema", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Place an order for the only polyester material variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt. After placing the order, send an email to B\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by searching for the products mentioned in the task.\nI found both products. Let me analyze the variants:\n\n**Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shi\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll start by searching for the products mentioned in the task.\nI found both products. Let me analyze the variants:\n\n**Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt** - The only polyester variant is:\n- `134d40ff4d60494698228fd0b32f72a6` (Material: Polyester, Color: Blue, Age Range: 4-6 years)\n\n**Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt** - The only red color variant is:\n- `3d0e68b48df64567bb8b9cbc85ecb9b4` (Color: Red, Size: Medium, Material: Cotton)\n\nLet me add the polyester variant of the Paw Patrol shirt to the cart and place the order.\nThe quantity needs to be an integer. Let me retry.\nLet me try without the quantity parameter (default is 1).\nThe item is added to the cart. Let me verify the cart contents and then checkout.\nThere's a notification about an order being cancelled. Let me check the orders to understand the situation.\nNo orders exist yet. The notification about a cancelled order seems to be a system event unrelated to my actions (I haven't placed an order yet). Let me proceed with checkout.\nThe order has been placed with ID `37c342ef53d34d5a93197800bff45c4d`. Let me verify the order details.\nThe order is confirmed (status: processed) for the polyester variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt.\n\nNow I need to send an email to Birgitta Larsson. Let me find her contact information first.\nI found Birgitta Larsson's email: `birgitta.larsson@gaia2mail.com`. Let me send the email.\nThe recipients parameter needs to be a list. Let me retry.\nThe email has been sent to Birgitta Larsson (email ID: `10665493fc19f13aaf37f75d9e921f2e`).\n\nNow I need to send you a message confirming that the email has been sent. Let me get the current user details to know who \"me\" is.\nThe current user is Astrid Lundqvist (phone: +46734567890). Let me send a message confirming the email has been sent.\nI've completed the initial steps. Now I need to wait for a possible follow-up from the user regarding whether the order should be canceled (if Birgitta wanted the other product). Let me wait for the notification.\nNo notification arrived within the wait period. Let me check if there are any unread messages from the user that might indicate the order should be canceled.\nNo unread messages. Let me also check the messages app in case Birgitta or the user responded there, and check the order status to confirm it hasn't been canceled.\nThe order is still \"processed\" (not canceled). Let me check recent conversations with proper integer types.\nThe tool seems to require integer types but is receiving strings. Let me try a different approach to check for messages - I'll wait a bit longer for any notification about the order being canceled.\nNo notifications have arrived. The order remains in \"processed\" status and has not been canceled. \n\nBased on the task instructions, the conditional steps (cancel order, place new order for the other product, send email, send confirmation message) only execute \"If the order is canceled.\" Since the order has NOT been canceled, those conditional steps are not triggered.\n\nLet me do a final verification of the completed work:\n\n1. ✅ **Placed order** for the only polyester variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt (Order ID: `37c342ef53d34d5a93197800bff45c4d`, status: processed)\n2. ✅ **Sent email** to Birgitta Larsson letting her know to cancel the order if she wanted the only red color variant of the Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt (Email ID: `10665493fc19f13aaf37f75d9e921f2e`)\n3. ✅ **Sent confirmation message** to the user (Astrid) confirming the email was sent (Message ID: `c4824370df1ebd1f2bd9d7284c8122fb`)\n4. ⏸️ **Conditional steps** (cancel order, order other product, email, message) — NOT triggered because the order has not been canceled\n\nAll required actions for the current state have been completed. The order is still active and the conditional branch has not been activated. Let me send a final confirmation message to the user summarizing the status.\nI have completed all the required actions for the current state of the task:\n\n**Completed:**\n1. ✅ **Placed the order** for the only polyester material variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt (Order ID: `37c342ef53d34d5a93197800bff45c4d`, status: processed, $19.99, Blue, 4-6 years).\n2. ✅ **Sent the email** to Birgitta Larsson (`birgitta.larsson@gaia2mail.com`) letting her know to cancel the order if she wanted the only red color variant of the Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt rather than the product I bought (Email ID: `10665493fc19f13aaf37f75d9e921f2e`).\n3. ✅ **Sent you a confirmation message** that the email was sent (Message ID: `c4824370df1ebd1f2bd9d7284c8122fb`), plus a summary message.\n\n**Conditional steps not yet triggered:**\nThe task specifies that if the order is canceled, I should place an order for the other product (Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt, red variant), email Birgitta about the new order, and send you a confirmation. I waited for notifications and checked the order status — the order remains **\"processed\" (not canceled)**, so those conditional steps have not been activated.\n\nIf Birgitta responds that she wanted the other product and the order gets canceled, I'll automatically handle the new order, the email to Birgitta, and the confirmation message to you.\nI'll verify the current state of everything before delivering the final answer. Let me check the order status, the email, and whether any cancellation has occurred.\nThe order remains \"processed\" (not canceled), there are no unread messages, and no cancellation has occurred. The conditional branch (cancel order → order the other product → email Birgitta → confirm to user) is therefore not triggered.\n\nAll required actions for the current state are complete. Let me deliver the final answer to the user.\nI have delivered the final answer to the user. \n\nTo recap the completed work:\n- ✅ Placed the order for the polyester variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt (Order ID: `37c342ef53d34d5a93197800bff45c4d`, status: processed)\n- ✅ Sent the email to Birgitta Larsson about canceling if she wanted the red Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt instead\n- ✅ Sent the user a confirmation message that the email was sent\n- ⏸️ The conditional branch (cancel → order other product → email → confirm) was not triggered because the order remains active and uncanceled\n\nThe task is fully handled for the current state.\nNo new notification arrived during the wait. Let me also double-check for any unread messages from the user to be thorough.\nNo new message or notification has arrived. The task remains in its completed state:\n\n- ✅ Order placed for the polyester variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt (Order ID: `37c342ef53d34d5a93197800bff45c4d`, status: processed)\n- ✅ Email sent to Birgitta Larsson about canceling if she wanted the red Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt instead\n- ✅ Confirmation message sent to the user\n- ⏸️ Conditional branch not triggered (order not canceled)\n\nThere is no follow-up request to handle. The task is fully complete for the current state, and I have already delivered the final answer to the user.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c18f4e95-62e7-49c1-9cb7-fa122366c0fb", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-ab28fbb0-2829-4aa7-accc-27aff5f87320"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "134d40ff4d60494698228fd0b32f72a6", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "1", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c9ebf837-7dac-42f3-bac4-bb9e78e835f2", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-c18f4e95-62e7-49c1-9cb7-fa122366c0fb"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-92362fd4-c091-4815-9394-3c1ebebeb434", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-c9ebf837-7dac-42f3-bac4-bb9e78e835f2"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"birgitta.larsson@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Order Confirmation", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Birgitta,\n\nIf you wanted the only red color variant of the Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt rather than the only polyester material variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt then please cancel the order.\n\nBest,\nAstrid", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-84643d46-b599-4d2d-96d4-3a057ed0ed67", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-92362fd4-c091-4815-9394-3c1ebebeb434"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "The email has been sent.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-a6eb48b8-cd92-4087-b509-e640dc19f98e", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-31b8e097-4c42-4745-9c67-df99ad6eb7f5"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "3d0e68b48df64567bb8b9cbc85ecb9b4", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "1", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c04754b0-aab0-4e04-a1de-00adacf0ee5c", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-a6eb48b8-cd92-4087-b509-e640dc19f98e"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-70a8c215-6089-4c2d-9f1d-43adfa5bd1f8", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-c04754b0-aab0-4e04-a1de-