{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:13:59.470984", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_uig9ac", "task_desc": "Create a new contact in my contact list with the first name Arnold, the last name Schwarzenegger, and the email address arnold@fitness.com. After you have him added, send him an email with the subject \"Biceps Exercises?\" and in the content, ask him for his top 5 biceps exercises. This coming Sunday, create an event titled \"Apartment Tour\" from 2:00 to 4:00 that afternoon. Find the lowest priced property on my saved apartments list in the 211 43 zip code that has a Gym as an amenity and let me kn", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Create a new contact in my contact list with the first name Arnold, the last name Schwarzenegger, and the email address arnold@fitness.com. After you \nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break down this task into sub-requests:\n1. Create contact Arnold Schwarzenegger with email arnold@fitness.com\n2. Send him an email with subject \"Biceps Exe\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll break down this task into sub-requests:\n1. Create contact Arnold Schwarzenegger with email arnold@fitness.com\n2. Send him an email with subject \"Biceps Exercises?\" asking for top 5 biceps exercises\n3. Create a calendar event \"Apartment Tour\" this coming Sunday 2:00-4:00 PM\n4. Find lowest priced saved apartment in 211 43 zip with Gym amenity, report name\n5. Order default cab from Home at 1:00 PM this Sunday to that property\n6. Send private Chats message to Vasco Pinto asking about gyms in 211 43\n\nLet me start by creating the contact and gathering info on saved apartments and the current date.\nThe contact is created. Now let me check the saved apartments more thoroughly - I need to find ones in zip code \"211 43\" with Gym amenity. The list seems truncated. Let me search saved apartments with the specific filters.\nLet me fix the boolean type.\nThe tool requires a proper boolean. Let me try without saved_only and filter manually, but first let me get the full saved apartments list since it was truncated.\nThe list is being truncated in display. Let me search all apartments (not just saved) with the zip code and Gym filter to find candidates, then cross-reference with saved list.\nFound one apartment in zip 211 43 with Gym: \"Malmö Modern\" (saved: true, price 1300). Let me verify it's in the saved list by checking the full saved list. The saved list display was truncated, but this property shows \"saved\": true. Let me confirm by getting its details and also verify it appears in saved apartments. Let me check the saved list again - it was truncated at \"Uppsala Oasis\". Let me get the apartment details to confirm.\n\"Malmö Modern\" is confirmed saved, in zip 211 43, with Gym amenity, price 1300. It's the only one matching the criteria, so it's the lowest priced. \n\nNow let me determine this coming Sunday's date. Current date is 2024-10-15 (Tuesday). This coming Sunday is 2024-10-20. Let me proceed with the remaining actions: send email, create calendar event, order cab, and send Chats message to Vasco Pinto.\n\nLet me first get Vasco Pinto's user id for Chats, and send the email.\nGot Vasco Pinto's id. Let me fix the email recipients to be a list.\nEmail sent. Now let me create the calendar event for this coming Sunday (2024-10-20) 2:00-4:00 PM, order the cab, and send the Chats message to Vasco Pinto.\nAll actions are complete. Let me verify the task sub-requests:\n\n1. ✅ Created contact Arnold Schwarzenegger (arnold@fitness.com)\n2. ✅ Sent email with subject \"Biceps Exercises?\" asking for top 5 biceps exercises\n3. ✅ Created calendar event \"Apartment Tour\" on Sunday 2024-10-20, 2:00-4:00 PM\n4. ✅ Found lowest priced saved apartment in 211 43 with Gym: \"Malmö Modern\" (price 1300)\n5. ✅ Ordered default cab from Home at 1:00 PM Sunday to the property (BOOKED)\n6. ✅ Sent private Chats message to Vasco Pinto about gyms in 211 43\n\nAll sub-requests are done. Let me report back to the user.\nAll tasks have been completed successfully. Here's the summary of what was accomplished:\n\n1. **Contact created**: Arnold Schwarzenegger (arnold@fitness.com)\n2. **Email sent**: \"Biceps Exercises?\" asking for his top 5 biceps exercises\n3. **Calendar event**: \"Apartment Tour\" on Sunday, Oct 20, 2024, 2:00–4:00 PM\n4. **Property identified**: **Malmö Modern** (Södra Förstadsgatan 20, Malmö) — the lowest priced saved apartment in zip 211 43 with a Gym amenity (price 1300)\n5. **Cab booked**: Default ride from Home at 1:00 PM Sunday to Malmö Modern (BOOKED)\n6. **Chat message sent**: To Vasco Pinto asking about good gyms in 211 43\n\nThe task is fully done.\nNo new follow-up message arrived within the wait window. All sub-requests from the original task have been completed and verified:\n\n1. ✅ Contact Arnold Schwarzenegger (arnold@fitness.com) created\n2. ✅ Email \"Biceps Exercises?\" sent asking for top 5 biceps exercises\n3. ✅ Calendar event \"Apartment Tour\" created for Sunday, Oct 20, 2024, 2:00–4:00 PM\n4. ✅ Lowest priced saved apartment in 211 43 with Gym: **Malmö Modern** (price 1300)\n5. ✅ Default cab booked from Home at 1:00 PM Sunday to Malmö Modern (BOOKED)\n6. ✅ Private Chats message sent to Vasco Pinto about gyms in 211 43\n\nThe task is fully complete. No further action is needed.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-338b1dad-9bc0-4b6d-b3ec-d9c8efa7a9b0", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-56270572-7b98-4c1d-8637-2b85818990e8"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Contacts", "function": "add_new_contact", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "first_name", "value": "Arnold", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "last_name", "value": "Schwarzen