: [{"name": "content", "value": "There are multiple Åsa's that have emailed you. Which should I reply to?", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.2857142857142857, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "ambiguity", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 534, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.1, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "5c172812", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "eaae534dbfcc", "prof_total_s": 1207.27, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 1207.27, "prof_tok_in": 273965, "prof_tok_out": 3137, "prof_llm_calls": 14}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:14:24.066881", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_22_3sml2v", "task_desc": "Save all New York apartments I haven't already saved and then let me know how many new listings were saved.", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Save all New York apartments I haven't already saved and then let me know how many new listings were saved.\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by listing all New York apartments and checking which ones are already saved.\nThe search results were truncated. Let me get the full list of New York\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll start by listing all New York apartments and checking which ones are already saved.\nThe search results were truncated. Let me get the full list of New York apartments and the full list of saved apartments.\nThe results are still truncated. Let me search specifically for New York apartments with `saved_only=False` to get the complete list, and also check the saved apartments more carefully.\nLet me fix the boolean type.\nThe string conversion isn't working. Let me try without the saved_only parameter but use the search to get all New York apartments. The earlier search returned truncated results. Let me try searching with a more specific approach to capture all New York listings.\nThe location search seems to be returning truncated results. Let me get the complete list of all apartments to identify all New York ones. The `list_all_apartments` was also truncated. Let me try the search with location \"New York\" again and also try to get a complete picture. Let me search by zip code ranges for New York (100xx).\nI've now found all New York apartments across the zip codes. Let me compile the complete list of New York apartments and their saved status:\n\n**New York apartments found:**\n1. `185a973528014a37840b3496081019e6` - Skyline Views (10001) - saved: false\n2. `ab3c928ced1042b3afc6323c03b3f4dd` - Soho Oasis (10012) - saved: false\n3. `7c21f91fb0444e2a8662a3cb3c619d9d` - The Vue (10013) - saved: true\n4. `4ac63b62b69b4c7d9d4c471ba88f2f4e` - Parkside Residences (10021) - saved: false\n5. `a31094b1d29a488bafb50ef8c383491a` - The Lexington (10021) - saved: false\n6. `df71f4dbe1334b7d9c7517e92caa7b31` - Aurora Heights (10024) - saved: false\n7. `ff3857d6523943eca517a397737a80e3` - New York Nest (10003) - saved: true\n\nThe two already saved (The Vue, New York Nest) are confirmed in the saved list. The other 5 are not saved. Let me save the 5 unsaved ones.\nAll 5 unsaved New York apartments have been saved. Let me verify by checking the saved apartments list.\nThe saved list is truncated in display, but the save operations returned success. Let me verify the 5 newly saved apartments are now marked as saved by checking each one's details.\nAll 5 apartments are now confirmed as saved. The task is complete.\n\nI found 7 New York apartments total. Two were already saved (The Vue and New York Nest), and I saved the remaining 5 that weren't already in your favorites.\nTask complete. I saved all 5 New York apartments that weren't already in your favorites, and let you know the count.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-4d600a4c-bf05-401f-8a78-46807a027e9f", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-d4662dc8-d4b9-4c0e-9235-19ab74914914"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "RentAFlat", "function": "save_apartment", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "apartment_id", "value": "df71f4dbe1334b7d9c7517e92caa7b31", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_tim