{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:19:14.409561", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_5e0gvz", "task_desc": "I need to book a whole day with my friend who’s a Film Producer in Stockholm. Cancel any appointments I have scheduled for this upcoming Saturday and schedule an event titled “Film Production Day” from 8 AM to 8 PM on that day, adding my friend as an attendee. Send him an email after scheduling the event, with the appointment details. Let me know when you’ve done these things. If my friend says he can’t make it, accept any suggested date and time he proposes and reschedule the “Film Production D", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "I'll start by understanding the task. Let me break it down:\n1. Find my friend who's a Film Producer in Stockholm (in contacts)\n2. Check my appointments for this upcoming Saturday\n3. Cancel Saturday appointments\n4. Schedule \"Film Production Day\" event 8 AM - 8 PM Saturday with friend as attendee\n5. Send friend an email with appointment details\n6. Wait for friend's response - handle rescheduling logic\n\nLet me first gather information about my contacts and calendar.\nThe search for \"Film Producer Stockholm\" returned nothing. Let me search more broadly and get the full calendar for the week. Today is Tuesday, 2024-10-15, so this upcoming Saturday is 2024-10-19.\nI found my friend: **Åke Lindström**, a Film Producer in Stockholm (email: ake.lindstrom@filmproduktion.se).\n\nNow let me get the full calendar for the week to see all Saturday (2024-10-19) appointments.\nI found one Saturday appointment: \"Brand Partnership Meeting\" on Saturday, 2024-10-19 from 14:00 to 16:00. Let me cancel it and schedule the \"Film Production Day\" event. I'll do both in parallel since they're independent.\nThe Saturday appointment is cancelled and the \"Film Production Day\" event is scheduled (event_id: d1a1e136f1cff3192730c61913ffb05a). Now let me send Åke an email with the appointment details.\nThe recipients parameter needs to be a list. Let me retry.\nThe email was sent. There are two new emails received — one from mlsousasilva@gaia2mail.com (likely the user) and one from Åke Lindström (my friend). Let me read both to check if Åke can make it.\nÅke replied: **\"Sorry, I can't make it that day. I can do Thursday 17th instead at the same time.\"**\n\nSo per the task logic:\n- He can't make it → accept his suggested date/time\n- Reschedule \"Film Production Day\" to Thursday, October 17, 2024, 8 AM – 8 PM\n- Cancel any appointments I have on Thursday, October 17\n\nLet me check my appointments on Thursday, October 17.\nI have 5 appointments on Thursday, October 17 that need to be cancelled:\n1. Content Creation Session (10:00-12:00)\n2. Social Media Management (12:00-14:00)\n3. Brand Partnership Meeting (14:00-16:00)\n4. Yoga Class (18:00-19:00)\n5. Personal Project Work (20:00-22:00)\n\nLet me cancel all of them, and reschedule the Film Production Day event to Thursday, October 17, 8 AM – 8 PM. I'll do these in parallel.\nAll Thursday appointments cancelled and the Film Production Day rescheduled to Thursday, October 17, 8 AM – 8 PM. Now let me email Åke to confirm the new date/time.\nAll actions are complete. Let me verify the final state of the calendar for both days to confirm everything is correct.\nEverything is confirmed. The calendar now shows:\n- **Thursday, Oct 17**: Film Production Day (8 AM – 8 PM) with Åke Lindström ✓ (all 5 prior appointments cancelled)\n- **Saturday, Oct 19**: No appointments (the Brand Partnership Meeting was cancelled) ✓\n- Friday, Oct 18 events are untouched (not affected)\n\nAll tasks are complete. Let me notify the user.\nThe task is fully complete. Here's what was accomplished:\n\n1. **Identified the friend**: Åke Lindström, Film Producer in Stockholm.\n2. **Cancelled Saturday (Oct 19) appointment**: The \"Brand Partnership Meeting\" was removed.\n3. **Scheduled \"Film Production Day\"**: Created for Saturday, Oct 19, 8 AM–8 PM with Åke as attendee.\n4. **Emailed Åke** the appointment details.\n5. **Handled Åke's response**: He couldn't make Saturday and proposed Thursday, Oct 17 at the same time. I accepted it by:\n   - Cancelling all 5 of your Thursday, Oct 17 appointments.\n   - Rescheduling \"Film Production Day\" to Thursday, Oct 17, 8 AM–8 PM with Åke as attendee.\n   - Sending Åke a confirmation email.\n\nAll sub-requests have been fulfilled.\nNo new follow-up message arrived within the wait window. The task remains fully complete:\n\n- ✅ Found friend Åke Lindström (Film Producer, Stockholm)\n- ✅ Cancelled Saturday (Oct 19) \"Brand Partnership Meeting\"\n- ✅ Scheduled \"Film Production Day\" (8 AM–8 PM)\n- ✅ Emailed Åke the appointment details\n- ✅ Åke declined Saturday and proposed Thursday, Oct 17 → accepted his suggestion, cancelled all 5 Thursday appointments, rescheduled the event to Thursday, Oct 17 (8 AM–8 PM), and confirmed via email\n\nNo further action is needed.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-9ca29aa0-de61-43b9-8784-1181580bc6b2", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-18ffbb0b-c192-4b7d-8c98-352ac9ba1008"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "Film Production Day", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 08:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 20:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "location", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "attendees", "value": "[\"Åke Lindström\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-