{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:19:14.410125", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_2on5mg", "task_desc": "I have a networking event later today with two attendees. Can you book me a Default cab from the Malmo airport at 230 32 Malmö-Sturup to Norra Vallgatan 60, 211 22 Malmö at 5:30pm today? Also, check with both attendees of my networking event to see if they can still make it and if they want to get a taxi from the airport to the venue via sending separate emails. Let me know when you've scheduled the cab and sent the emails. If both attendees can make it, cancel the existing cab, and create the s", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: I have a networking event later today with two attendees. Can you book me a Default cab from the Malmo airport at 230 32 Malmö-Sturup to Norra Vallgat\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by understanding the task. Let me break it down:\n\n1. Book a Default cab from Malmo airport (230 32 Malmö-Sturup) to Norra Vallgatan 60, 211 22 Malmö \nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll break this task down into sub-requests:\n1. Book a Default cab from Malmo airport (230 32 Malmö-Sturup) to Norra Vallgatan 60, 211 22 Malmö at 5:30pm today\n2. Find the networking event and its two attendees\n3. Send separate emails to both attendees asking if they can still make it and if they want a taxi from airport to venue\n4. Wait for responses, then based on responses:\n   - If both can make it: cancel Default cab, book Premium cab, email both with new cab details\n   - If either can't: keep Default cab, email non-attendee with understanding message, email attending one with cab details\n\nLet me start by booking the cab and finding the networking event.\nThe Default cab is booked (ride_id: 429a88d0a3032b0d5ff7712d44993993). Now I need to find the networking event \"later today\" (2024-10-15). Let me search more specifically and check today's events.\nI found today's Networking Event (event_id: 541223c32f0b40edb923a728928ace2c) with two attendees: **Astrid Mikkelsen** and **Beshoy Gadallah**. \n\nI also see two new emails have arrived from both attendees. Let me read those emails to see their responses, and get the current user's details for the email signature.\nThe current user is Astrid Lundqvist. Let me list the inbox emails with the correct offset type.\nThe tool seems to require an integer. Let me try without the offset parameter.\nBoth attendees have already responded (these are the emails that arrived as notifications):\n- **Astrid Mikkelsen**: \"Sure thing! I am still attending, count me in for the taxi, too!\"\n- **Beshoy Gadallah**: \"Yes, I can still make it and I'll grab a taxi with you guys as planned.\"\n\nWait — the task says to first send emails to both attendees asking if they can make it, THEN wait for responses. But the responses already arrived. Let me re-read the task carefully.\n\nThe task flow:\n1. Book Default cab ✓ (done)\n2. Send separate emails to both attendees asking if they can still make it and if they want a taxi\n3. Let user know when cab scheduled and emails sent\n4. Wait for responses, then act based on responses\n\nThe emails from attendees arrived as notifications, but I should still send the initial inquiry emails as the task requires. However, the attendees have already responded. The task is conditional on their responses. Since both have confirmed they can make it, I should proceed with the \"both can make it\" branch.\n\nBut the task explicitly asks me to send the inquiry emails first. Let me send those inquiry emails to both attendees (as required), then since both have already confirmed, proceed with the Premium cab branch.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The task says \"check with both attendees... via sending separate emails\" and \"Let me know when you've scheduled the cab and sent the emails.\" Then \"If both attendees can make it, cancel the existing cab...\" \n\nThe responses have already come in (both confirming). I'll send the inquiry emails as instructed, then proceed based on the already-received confirmations. Let me get the attendees' email addresses and send the inquiry emails.\n\nI have their emails from the inbox:\n- Astrid Mikkelsen: astrid.mikkelsen@gaia2mail.com\n- Beshoy Gadallah: beshoy.gadallah@coptic-church.dk\n\nLet me send the inquiry emails to both.\nThe recipients parameter needs to be a list. Let me retry.\nBoth inquiry emails are sent. Now let me inform the user that the cab is scheduled and emails are sent, then check for responses. Both attendees already responded confirming they can make it. Let me verify by reading the response emails again and then proceed with the \"both can make it\" branch.\n\nLet me first notify the user, then handle the conditional logic. Since both attendees have already confirmed (emails received at 07:00:08), I'll proceed with the Premium cab branch. Let me cancel the Default cab and book the Premium cab.\nDefault cab cancelled. Now let me book the Premium cab with the same journey details.\nPremium cab booked (ride_id: 01a6205797dff55f2020b092a0fb5dfc). Now let me email both attendees separately, telling them I'll see them later and including the new cab details.\nAll actions are complete. Let me summarize what was done and notify the user.\n\nHere's a summary of everything completed:\n\n**Cab booking:**\n- ✅ Initially booked a **Default** cab from Malmö-Sturup airport (230 32 Malmö-Sturup) to Norra Vallgatan 60, 211 22 Malmö at 5:30pm today\n- ✅ Both attendees confirmed they could make it, so I **cancelled the Default cab** and **booked a Premium cab** with the same journey (ride_id: 01a6205797dff55f2020b092a0fb5dfc, ~27 min, ~4 min delay, ~29.48)\n\n**Emails:**\n- ✅ Sent separate inquiry emails to both attendees (Astrid Mikkelsen & Beshoy Gadallah) asking if they could make it and if they wanted a taxi\n- ✅ Both confirmed they could attend and wanted the taxi\n- ✅ Sent separate follow-up emails to both attendees telling them I'll see them later, including the new Premium cab details\n\nSince both attendees could make it, the task's \"both can make it\" branch was followed (Default → Premium cab, plus confirmation emails with cab details). No \"can't make it\" emails were needed.\nThe task is fully complete. All sub-requests have been handled:\n\n1. ✅ Booked the Default cab initially\n2. ✅ Found the networking event (today, 6:00pm) and its two attendees (Astrid Mikkelsen, Beshoy Gadallah)\n3. ✅ Sent separate inquiry emails to both attendees\n4. ✅ Both confirmed they could make it and wanted the taxi\n5. ✅ Cancelled the Default cab and booked the Premium cab with the same journey\n6. ✅ Sent separate confirmation emails to both attendees with the new cab details\n\nSince both attendees could make it, the \"both can make it\" branch was followed and no \"can't make it\" emails were required.\nNo new notifications arrived during the wait period. The task is fully complete, and there are no follow-up requests to handle.\n\nTo recap, everything requested has been accomplished:\n- ✅ Default cab booked, then cancelled after both attendees confirmed\n- ✅ Premium cab booked (same journey: Malmö-Sturup → Norra Vallgatan 60, 211 22 Malmö at 5:30pm today)\n- ✅ Separate inquiry emails sent to both attendees (Astrid Mikkelsen & Beshoy Gadallah)\n- ✅ Both confirmed attendance and wanting the taxi\n- ✅ Separate confirmation emails sent to both with the new Premium cab details\n\nThe task is done.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-f916c9ac-e63e-4919-b932-5e395bb1acc2", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-9ba0aa71-9148-4c90-b22b-5dc2073b3536"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"astrid.mikkelsen@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Confirmation for Networking Event Today", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Astrid, \nCan you still make it to the networking event today? Would you like to get a taxi from the Malmo airport to the venue? \nBest, \nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-4fb26438-2533-4c8b-9e83-22b7c0bc70b8", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-9ba0aa71-9148-4c90-b22b-5dc2073b3536"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"beshoy.gadallah@coptic-church.dk\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Confirmation for Networking Event Today", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Beshoy, \nCan you still make it to the networking event today? Would you like to get a taxi from the Malmo airport to the venue? \nBest, \nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-18f8b6fe-8133-4125-88e1-bc414049606e", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-9ba0aa71-9148-4c90-b22b-5dc2073b3536"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Cabs", "function": "order_ride", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "start_location", "value": "230 32 Malmö-Sturup, Malmö", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_location", "value": "Norra Vallgatan 60, 211 22 Malmö", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "service_type", "value": "Default", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "ride_time", "value": "2024-10-15 17:30:00", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975634.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-31806756-7fc9-42e7-8dec-0670f09e3594", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-7fc98bbc-0696-483b-9d9f-f100dc74296f"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Cabs", "function": "order_ride", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "start_location", "value": "230 32 Malmö-Sturup Malmö", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_location", "value": "Norra Vallgatan 60, 211 22 Malmö", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "service_type", "value": "Premium", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "ride_time", "value": "2024-10-15 17:30:00", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975635.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-5036d478-5cc7-40a6-9635-7f46fad2f0bc", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-31806756-7fc9-42e7-8dec-0670f09e3594"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"beshoy.gadallah@coptic-church.dk\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "See you later - Cab Details", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Beshoy, \nI'll see you later. I've booked a Premium cab from the Malmo airport to the venue, departing at 5:30 PM today. \nBest,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975635.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-b9e9df70-f58f-4986-9a4d-e35b3e2ed18b", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-31806756-7fc9-42e7-8dec-0670f09e3594"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"astrid.mikkelsen@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "See you later - Cab Details", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "\nHi Astrid, \nI'll see you later. I've booked a Premium cab from the Malmo airport to the venue, departing at 5:30 PM today. \nBest,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975602.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-54aa64c0-1422-4a51-be1a-03833b5ec235", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-f916c9ac-e63e-4919-b932-5e395bb1acc2", "OracleEvent-AGENT-4fb26438-2533-4c8b-9e83-22b7c0bc70b8", "OracleEvent-AGENT-18f8b6fe-8133-4125-88e1-bc414049606e"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "The cab has been ordered and the emails have been sent.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975633.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-7fc98bbc-0696-483b-9d9f-f100dc74296f", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-beff62a0-3115-4842-a008-ec62e7a4131a", "Event-ENV-0a763808-df3c-49d3-8879-9ef4d441adcd"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Cabs", "function": "user_cancel_ride", "operation_type": null, "args": []}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.25, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "adaptability", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 510, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.1, "fb_mode": "