{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:22:12.233141", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_3c1x8i", "task_desc": "Delete all the events scheduled on the last Friday of the current month. After cancelling the events, send separate emails to the attendees: one to Linnea, telling her that I've cancelled all our events scheduled on that day, and another email to Sunita, telling her that I've cancelled the Networking Event. \nSchedule an event named \"Social Media Campaign\" on that day, from 10AM to 6PM, in my office.\nReply to the last email sent by João Silva, telling him that I already scheduled a full day to pr", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Delete all the events scheduled on the last Friday of the current month. After cancelling the events, send separate emails to the attendees: one to Li\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break down this task into sub-requests:\n1. Find the last Friday of the current month (October 2024)\n2. Delete all events scheduled on that day\n3. Send emai\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll break down this task into sub-requests:\n1. Find the last Friday of the current month (October 2024)\n2. Delete all events scheduled on that day\n3. Send email to Linnea about cancelling all events on that day\n4. Send email to Sunita about cancelling the Networking Event\n5. Schedule \"Social Media Campaign\" event on that day, 10AM-6PM, in office\n6. Reply to last email from João Silva about the scheduled event\n\nLet me start by determining the current date and finding the last Friday of October 2024.\nThe current date is 2024-10-15 (Tuesday). October 2024 has 31 days. Let me find the last Friday.\n\nOctober 2024 calendar:\n- Oct 1 = Tuesday\n- Oct 4 = Friday (week 1)\n- Oct 11 = Friday (week 2)\n- Oct 18 = Friday (week 3)\n- Oct 25 = Friday (week 4)\n- Oct 31 = Thursday\n\nSo the last Friday of October 2024 is **October 25, 2024**.\n\nLet me get the calendar events for that day to find what's scheduled.\nI found 4 events on October 25, 2024 (last Friday):\n1. **Social Media Analytics** (09:00-11:00) - no attendees\n2. **Coffee Break with Linnea** (14:00-15:00) - Linnea\n3. **Yoga Class** (18:00-19:00) - Linnea\n4. **Networking Event** (19:00-21:00) - Linnea, Sunita\n\nLet me delete all 4 events. I'll do these in parallel.\nAll 4 events deleted. Now let me get the current user's details to know the sender info, and find the contacts for Linnea and Sunita to get their email addresses.\nI have the contacts. The attendees in the events were \"Linnea Åström\" (linnea.astrom@gaia2mail.com) and \"Sunita Bishwakarma\" (sunita.bishwakarma@gaia2mail.com).\n\nNow let me send the two emails. I'll send them in parallel.\nThe recipients need to be a list. Let me retry with list format.\nBoth emails sent. Now let me schedule the \"Social Media Campaign\" event on October 25, 2024, from 10AM to 6PM, in the office.\nEvent scheduled. Now I need to find the last email sent by João Silva to reply to it. Let me search for emails from him.\nI found the email from João Silva. Let me verify this is the last email he sent by checking the SENT folder isn't relevant (he's the sender, so it's in my INBOX). This is the only email from him. Let me reply to it with the event details.\nAll sub-requests are now complete. Let me verify the task is fully done by reviewing each item:\n\n1. ✅ **Last Friday of current month**: October 25, 2024\n2. ✅ **Deleted all events on that day**: Social Media Analytics, Coffee Break with Linnea, Yoga Class, Networking Event (all 4 deleted)\n3. ✅ **Email to Linnea**: Sent about cancelling all events on that day\n4. ✅ **Email to Sunita**: Sent about cancelling the Networking Event\n5. ✅ **Scheduled \"Social Media Campaign\"**: Oct 25, 10AM-6PM, in office\n6. ✅ **Replied to João Silva**: Told him about the full-day event with details\n\nAll tasks are complete. Let me provide a summary to the user.\nThe task has been fully completed. All six sub-requests were accomplished:\n\n1. **Last Friday identified**: October 25, 2024\n2. **All 4 events deleted** from that day\n3. **Email sent to Linnea** about cancelling all events\n4. **Email sent to Sunita** about cancelling the Networking Event\n5. **\"Social Media Campaign\" event scheduled** (Oct 25, 10AM–6PM, office)\n6. **Reply sent to João Silva** with the event details", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-fa786435-76be-4bc0-af71-19c26082b2fa", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-0d490ab7-cdab-427b-9735-8e73c3a6affa"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "8b721e7b0dcf4390b81f7297cc0f6ed2", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-5ffe025f-6c83-4a7f-815a-abd6acb07058", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-0d490ab7-cdab-427b-9735-8e73c3a6affa"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "b4dcf0f1b5054df3b6e938a5de4fa4c4", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-904b4b2c-2989-45bc-8253-a8964bf4f139", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-0d490ab7-cdab-427b-9735-8e73c3a6affa"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "b87b0e6f2b1a4f58a19e1bc5d694b315", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0